[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4800.63, "timestamp": "01:20:00", "text": "搭个桥什么的。我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4802.95, "timestamp": "01:20:02", "text": "这很合理，因为它就像发芽一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4804.95, "timestamp": "01:20:04", "text": "地上的东西。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4807.51, "timestamp": "01:20:07", "text": "耶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4811.11, "timestamp": "01:20:11", "text": "我变成了棕色的草。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4812.55, "timestamp": "01:20:12", "text": "你想那样做吗？如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4814.229, "timestamp": "01:20:14", "text": "所以，我要消耗这个资源。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4818.95, "timestamp": "01:20:18", "text": "是的。是的。哦，我可以，我可以做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4821.43, "timestamp": "01:20:21", "text": "呃，桥。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4823.27, "timestamp": "01:20:23", "text": "好的。好了。 20平方英尺。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4825.75, "timestamp": "01:20:25", "text": "大概是20平方英尺。嗯，让我想想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4827.83, "timestamp": "01:20:27", "text": "呃，让我把“到底在哪儿”这个问题说出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4829.03, "timestamp": "01:20:29", "text": "测量模板？好了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4831.11, "timestamp": "01:20:31", "text": "好的。好了。都在那里。现在是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4833.35, "timestamp": "01:20:33", "text": "地面变得乱成一团。它，它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4835.51, "timestamp": "01:20:35", "text": "现在粘性小了很多。这容易得多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4838.07, "timestamp": "01:20:38", "text": "如果你想的话，可以拉拉你的手"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4840.95, "timestamp": "01:20:40", "text": "出去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4843.43, "timestamp": "01:20:43", "text": "是的。好的。呃，而且也不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4845.99, "timestamp": "01:20:45", "text": "地形崎岖，因为这就是工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4847.51, "timestamp": "01:20:47", "text": "帮助你。好的。还有其他什么吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4848.87, "timestamp": "01:20:48", "text": "轮到你了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4851.83, "timestamp": "01:20:51", "text": "呃，我该怎么玩？呃，怎么放置？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4852.95, "timestamp": "01:20:52", "text": "哦，已经放好了。不用担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4854.07, "timestamp": "01:20:54", "text": "对，就是这样。好的。好的。全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4855.75, "timestamp": "01:20:55", "text": "正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4858.149, "timestamp": "01:20:58", "text": "呃"}]